  gatewayIntroCopy: "{imageCount} black and white WWII Men and Machines fine art prints by Wayne Heim, available as fine art prints from the small-works \"Sketch Series\" at $25 through ultra-limited signed collector editions. Painterly WWII inspired photography of combat, vehicles, infantry action, and the wartime hardware of the second world war — every image a complete machine and soldier story stripped to tonal depth, mechanical detail, and wartime atmosphere. Four edition tiers — open-edition studies to ultra-limited signed collector works — on fine art paper and Baltic Birch wood panels.",
